 Screenshot 4.png", "id": "873992396602223", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974864_873992399935556_1633622422788963725_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jxOnV0pRe-IQ7kNvwGZXrn-&_nc_oc=AdqcrMfopqCBchXXDKquUYBqDjMFzxCB62o_gmldnWDeMqWFMXoXfHGIZfHsLcpOWwk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2VtYlef-tgt6tk9lZ_E3iI6FtB3q6VZ0l4-RQZ8xwbag&oe=69DA343E"}, {"file_name": "EEC Screenshot 5.png", "id": "5395686713791034", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974748_5395686717124367_6902466276144487558_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=c5tUbNGdTAQQ7kNvwE53wdK&_nc_oc=AdrReZgxAmCjWgDHf63yq3Wf0XQI9pPCYWLraArMlrdE1sV_wizO2EDuIsFZW5e4GnE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0dJqlXjFV-ftk0s7udRTrinN3rPgRN3i_1dm2D37hIKw&oe=69DA3286"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Ellic's Exercise Class", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is a VR exergame called \u201cEllic\u2019s Exercise Class\u201d. Ellic will guide you through the play. The game includes seven mini exercise games: blocking, goalkeeper, volleyball, archery, skeet, baseball, and shooter. You will interact with virtual objects by moving your body and arms and triggering sporting events with the handheld controllers. Join Ellic's Exercise Class today! Each mini-game has three difficulty levels, and there must be a level right for you!", "short_description": "This is a VR exergame called \u201cEllic\u2019s Exercise Class\u201d. Ellic will guide you through the play. The game includes seven mini exercise games: blocking, goalkeeper, volleyball, archery, skeet, baseball, and shooter. You will interact with virtual objects by moving your body and arms and triggering sporting events with the handheld controllers. Join Ellic's Exercise Class today! Each mini-game has three difficulty levels, and there must be a level right for you!"}]}, "developer_